#%PAM-1.0
# PAM service of installer-wizard.service and console-getty.service
# (PAMName=installer-console, User=root).
#
# It exists so that these units run inside a systemd-logind session on seat0 and
# the VT: libseat (kmscon --libseat) needs that session to take the seat. It
# ships with the image rather than with kmscon, so the getty fallback of those
# same units never depends on the kmscon package being present.
#
# systemd runs the account and session stacks only; there is nothing to
# authenticate (root, started by the service manager).
account    required     pam_permit.so
session    required     pam_permit.so
# The leading dash ignores a missing pam_systemd.so: no session, no libseat,
# and console-session.sh then uses kmscon on its own or getty.
-session   optional     pam_systemd.so type=tty class=greeter
